sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Student browser
    participant API as API task (Fargate)
    participant DB as RDS PostgreSQL
    participant S3 as S3 uploads bucket
    participant Q as SQS uploads queue
    participant U as upload-fn (Lambda)
    participant EQ as SQS email queue
    participant E as email-fn (Lambda)
    participant SES as Amazon SES
    actor T as Tutor

    S->>API: POST /api/uploads/presign (name, type, size = 40 MB)
    API->>API: check PDF/ZIP, max 50 MB, assignment exists
    API->>DB: insert submission row (status = pending)
    API-->>S: presigned POST (URL + signed fields, valid 5 min)
    S->>S3: POST the 40 MB file directly (never touches the API)
    S3->>S3: enforce size limit and content type, encrypt, store
    S3-)Q: ObjectCreated event
    Q->>U: deliver event
    U->>DB: status = received, size, time
    U->>EQ: send email request for the tutor
    EQ->>E: deliver message
    E->>SES: SendEmail
    SES-->>T: "New submission: Assignment 2"
    S->>API: GET /api/submissions/id (polls every 2 s)
    API-->>S: status = received, your tutor has been notified
